      en: ["The Roman settlement of Ratae Corieltauvorum was established here around 48 AD.", "The skeleton of King Richard III was discovered in a Greyfriars parking lot in 2012.", "Leicester's National Space Centre features a 42-meter high Rocket Tower.", "The city's Belgrave Road hosts the largest Diwali celebrations outside of Asia.", "Leicester was the birthplace of Thomas Cook, who founded the world's first travel agency.", "Leicester Cathedral dates back to the year 1086, according to the Domesday Book."],
