      en: ["1721: Opening of Lombe's Silk Mill, Britain's first fully mechanized factory.", "1977: Year Derby was officially granted city status by the Queen.", "1907: Year Rolls-Royce established its major manufacturing base here.", "1731: Completion of the 212-foot tower of Derby Cathedral.", "1840: Year the first railway station opened in the city of Derby.", "60,000: Number of people employed in the city's transport industry."],
