      en: ["Center of hat-making", "Luton Airport (LTN) location", "Headquarters of Vauxhall Motors", "St Mary's Church (12th century)"],
      es: ["Centro de la sombrerería", "Aeropuerto de Luton (LTN)", "Sede central de Vauxhall Motors", "Iglesia de Santa María (siglo XII)"],
